  "job_B15.5.9_20251003_114328": {
    "text": "Se fruma w\u00e6s \u00fe\u00e6t mon forst\u00e6l \u00e6nne wimman \u00e6t Ieceslea \u00e6lfsige Byrhsiges suna.\n\u00deurwif hatte se wimman.\n\u00dea befeng \u00e6lfsige \u00feone mann \u00e6t Wulfstane Wulfgares f\u00e6der.\n\u00dea tymde Wulfstan hine to \u00e6\u00feelstane \u00e6t Sunnanbyrg.\n\u00dea cende he tem & let \u00feone forberstan & forbeh \u00feone andagan.\n\u00c6fter \u00feam b\u00e6d \u00e6lfsige \u00e6giftes his mannes & he hine agef & forgeald him mid twam pundum.\n\u00dea b\u00e6d Byrhfer\u00f0 ealdormann \u00e6\u00feelstan hys wer for \u00feam tembyrste.\n\u00dea cw\u00e6\u00f0 \u00e6\u00f0elstan \u00fe\u00e6t he n\u00e6fde him to syllanne.\n\u00dea cleopode Eadweard \u00e6\u00f0elstanes bro\u00f0or & cw\u00e6\u00f0, ic h\u00e6bbe Sunnanburges boc \u00f0e uncre yldran me\n\u00dea cw\u00e6\u00f0 \u00e6\u00f0elstan \u00fe\u00e6t him leofre w\u00e6re \u00fe\u00e6t hit to fyre o\u00f0\u00f0e flode gewurde \u00feonne he hit \u00e6fre gebide.\n\u00d0a cw\u00e6\u00f0 eadweard, hit is wyrse \u00fe\u00e6t uncer na\u00f0or hit n\u00e6bbe.\n\u00dea w\u00e6s \u00fe\u00e6t swa.\n& forbead Byrhfer\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t land \u00e6\u00f0elstane & he of ferde & gebeh under Wulfgare \u00e6t Nor\u00f0healum.\nBinnan \u00f0am wendun gewyrda & gewat Eadr\u00e6d cyng & feng Eadwig to rice.\n& wende \u00e6\u00f0elstan hine eft into Sunnanbyrg ungebetra \u00feinga.\n\u00dea geahsode \u00fe\u00e6t Eadwig cyng & gesealde \u00fe\u00e6t land Byrnrice & he feng to & wearp \u00e6\u00f0elstan ut.\nGemang \u00feam getidde \u00fe\u00e6t Myrce gecuran Eadgar to cynge & him anweald gesealdan ealra cynerihta.\n\u00dea gesohte \u00c6\u00f0elstan Eadgar cyng & b\u00e6d domes.\n\u00dea \u00e6tdemdon him Myrcna witan land buton he his wer agulde \u00feam cynge swa he o\u00f0rum \u00e6r sceolde.\n\u00dea n\u00e6fde he hwanon ne he hit Eadwearde his bre\u00f0er ge\u00f0afian nolde.\n\u00dea gesealde se cyng & gebecte \u00fe\u00e6t land \u00e6\u00f0elstane ealdormenn to h\u00e6bbenne & to syllanne for life & for\n\u00c6fter \u00feam getidde \u00fe\u00e6t Ecgfer\u00f0 gebohte boc & land \u00e6t \u00e6\u00f0elstane ealdormenn on cynges gewitnesse &\n\u00dea bet\u00e6hte Ecgfer\u00f0 on halre tungan land & boc on cynges gewitnesse Dunstane arcebisceope to\n\u00dea he geendod w\u00e6s \u00fea rad se bisceop to \u00feam cynge myngude \u00fe\u00e6re munde & his gewitnesse.\n\u00dea cw\u00e6\u00f0 se cyng him to andsware, mine witan habba\u00f0 \u00e6trec\u00f0 Ecgfer\u00f0e ealle his are \u00feurh \u00fe\u00e6t swyrd \u00fee\nNam \u00fea se cyng \u00f0a are \u00fee he ahte XX hyda \u00e6t Sendan X \u00e6t Sunnanbyrg, & forgef \u00e6lfhege ealdormenn.\n\u00dea bead se bisceop his wer \u00feam cynge.\n\u00dea cw\u00e6\u00f0 se cyng, \u00fe\u00e6t mihte beon geboden him wi\u00f0 cl\u00e6num legere ac ic h\u00e6bbe ealle \u00fea sp\u00e6ce to\n\u00de\u00e6s on syxtan gere gebohte se arcebisceop \u00e6t \u00e6lfhege ealdormenn \u00fe\u00e6t land \u00e6t Sendan mid XC\n& he him swa \u00fea land geagnian derr swa him se sealde \u00f0e to syllenne ahte & hi \u00feam se cyng sealde swa",
